Chinese Terms Unlocked: Handcrafted Economy 

Robotic arms, homemade aircraft, bionic robots — Guess what! Many of these innovative handicrafts are individually produced. High technologies, such as 3D printing, artificial intelligence (AI) and programming controls, enable individuals and micro-teams to turn innovative ideas into products, and even develop them into businesses. That is the booming "handcrafted economy". How did this economic pattern take off, and what new opportunities does it hold? In this episode of Chinese Terms Unlocked, come along with Mark and Jiangjiang as we dig into it. 

